  "title": "NeuroTechs Dataset for Stem Skills",
  "description": "This dataset contains EEG recordings collected as part of the NeuroTechs project examining STEM skills. Data were acquired using the Unicorn EEG device and converted to BIDS format, with signal values expressed in microvolts. The dataset is intended to support research on neural correlates of STEM-related cognitive processes.",
